custom_components/firewalla/wan_peak.py | 43 million | clamped to retention window
custom_components/firewalla/wan_peak.py | _allocate_flow | bounded by retention window clamp

# Fingerprint collisions bounded by WAN_PEAK_MAX_PAGES * WAN_PEAK_PAGE_LIMIT
custom_components/firewalla/wan_peak.py | fingerprint | bounded by pagination limits

# Rolling max summaries pruned to 31 days
custom_components/firewalla/wan_peak.py | most recent N dates | pruned to 31 days

